## Notes

The rule catalog is adapted from Wikipedia's [*Signs of AI Writing*](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing), a WikiProject AI Cleanup essay reorganized here from a detection field guide into prescriptive writing rules.

These rules describe overused defaults and formulaic patterns rather than literal word bans. A single em dash or one instance of "delve" is fine on its own; what matters is frequency and context, weighed case by case rather than run against a list of forbidden words.
